ight of physics-based movement. Push, topple, and shatter objects with impact. Precise and responsive controls give every action a tangible sense of momentum and balance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895170/extras/e182896b6503e46dbd6b05b6fcd7b444.avif?t=1772561696\" width=1560 height=179 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895170/extras/dda253c8c11d81e4fac649686257fb93.poster.avif?t=1772561696\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895170/extras/dda253c8c11d81e4fac649686257fb93.webm?t=1772561696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895170/extras/dda253c8c11d81e4fac649686257fb93.mp4?t=1772561696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into a somber, iron-veined labyrinth where every gear ticks with secrets. The air hums with silent voices, and shadows creep through rusted pipes as you explore a world that feels alive yet lifeless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895170/extras/c680e0343741b528055d187e4202af79.avif?t=1772561696\" width=1560 height=179 /></span>    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895170/extras/111441886b69f0aca85d910d9313abe5.poster.avif?t=1772561696\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.